{"name":"Flash in the Pan","hex":"#ff9977","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"flash in the pan","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A transient occurrence with no long-term impact.","A career notable for early success that is not followed by any significant accomplishment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/flash_in_the_pan"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flash pan","blocks":[{"text":"The flash pan or priming pan is a small receptacle for priming powder, found next to the touch hole on muzzle-loading guns. Flash pans are found on gonnes, matchlocks, wheellocks, snaplocks, snaphances, and flintlocks."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Hand_Cannon_%28Chong%29_MET_DT366859.jpg/330px-Hand_Cannon_%28Chong%29_MET_DT366859.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flash_pan","wikidata":"Q204196"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/PS8004046.jpg/500px-PS8004046.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/PS8004046.jpg/1280px-PS8004046.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/PS8004046.jpg/500px-PS8004046.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A matchlock firearm with its flash pan visible at center as a U-shaped depression","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APS8004046.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Flash_in_the_pan_Stevage.jpg/500px-Flash_in_the_pan_Stevage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Flash_in_the_pan_Stevage.jpg/1280px-Flash_in_the_pan_Stevage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conte